Hi,
I am seeing some issues with include files regarding thrust and assume there might be a fundamental issue.
I installed the stable build (need newest version for my GPU type) using the command:
pip install --upgrade torch==1.10.2+cu111 -f https://download.pytorch.org/whl/torch_stable.html
Note that the CUDA version on my system is 11.6. The version of torch works fine and can use the GPU without any problems.
However, when I try to compile an extension (see definition below), I get the following error:
